<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Hey Arthur!</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Arthur Hill</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Hey Arthur!</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">1eAL6SURJYr5yko6FClNDO</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:01.670" end="00:03.170">Hey Arthur!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:02.820" end="00:04.940" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Yeah?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:04.940" end="00:06.730">Tell us what's on your mind?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:06.730" end="00:09.810" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Alright!)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.810" end="00:11.310">Hey Arthur!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.800" end="00:12.520" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Yeah?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.520" end="00:15.530">Who's that girl that ruined your life?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.530" end="00:17.580">I was singing with the band</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.580" end="00:19.660">Tryna do my little dance</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.660" end="00:21.630">Then she came into my life</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.630" end="00:23.430">And fucked up all my plans</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.430" end="00:25.890">I been lending her my T-shirt</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.890" end="00:27.590">Trying not to deep</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.590" end="00:29.900">The way she only wants to</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.900" end="00:32.040">See me on the weekend</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.040" end="00:35.370">Now I'm wondering if I'm man enough</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.370" end="00:39.470">Yeah she got me stumbling like a man in love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.470" end="00:41.500">Now my heart is on the ropes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.500" end="00:43.520">And my eyes are nearly closed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.520" end="00:46.780">As I'm waiting for the final blow</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.780" end="00:48.280">She got me saying</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.190" end="00:49.690">Ooh!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.060" end="00:50.560">Ah!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.140" end="00:53.040">Hurt me again just like you do</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.040" end="00:54.540">Ah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.850" end="00:56.170">I wanna let you take it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.170" end="00:57.670">Too</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.960" end="00:58.460">Far</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.190" end="01:01.390">Every time you pull me close</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.390" end="01:04.040">And it feels a little bit like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.040" end="01:05.540">Ooh!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.260" end="01:06.760">Ah!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.010" end="01:08.170">Playing my heartstrings like a</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.170" end="01:09.990">Rockstar</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.990" end="01:12.010">I let you win like I'm a</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.010" end="01:13.770">Loser</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.770" end="01:17.210">Every time you pull me close</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.210" end="01:19.560">Oh I know you're gonna let me go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.560" end="01:21.650">I've been trying to keep it calm</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.650" end="01:23.650">But you love bending my arm</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.650" end="01:25.670">Yeah keep me where you want me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.670" end="01:28.370">With that silly little charm</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.370" end="01:30.040">And you get me every time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.040" end="01:32.170">Pull me back with a single line</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.170" end="01:34.280">I forgive in the blink of an eye</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.280" end="01:36.090">Two wrongs might make a right</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.090" end="01:39.540">Now I'm wondering if I'm man enough</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.540" end="01:43.530">Yeah she got me stumbling like a man in love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.530" end="01:45.690">Now my heart is on the ropes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.690" end="01:47.760">And my eyes are nearly closed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.760" end="01:50.720">As I'm waiting for the final blow</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.720" end="01:52.270">She got me saying</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.270" end="01:53.770">Ooh!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.020" end="01:54.520">Ah!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.270" end="01:57.110">Hurt me again just like you do</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.110" end="01:58.610">Ah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.070" end="02:00.130">I wanna let you take it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.130" end="02:01.630">Too</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.370" end="02:02.870">Far</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.260" end="02:05.410">Every time you pull me close</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.410" end="02:08.090">And it feels a little bit like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.090" end="02:09.590">Ooh!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.240" end="02:10.740">Ah!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.030" end="02:12.280">Playing my heartstrings like a</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.280" end="02:14.220">Rockstar</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.220" end="02:15.940">I let you win like I'm a</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.940" end="02:18.050">Loser</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.050" end="02:21.240">Every time you pull me close</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.240" end="02:24.090">Oh I know you're gonna let me go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.090" end="02:26.090">How many hits can I take</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.090" end="02:28.090">Before this little heart breaks</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.090" end="02:30.060">How many hits can I take</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.060" end="02:32.170">How many how many</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.170" end="02:34.130">How many hits can I take</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.130" end="02:35.940">Before this little heart breaks</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:35.940" end="02:38.140">How many hits can I take</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.140" end="02:40.120">How many how many</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.120" end="02:41.620">Ooh!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.080" end="02:44.080">Ah!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.080" end="02:48.080" /></div></body></tt>